  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsing the GEOBOARD application on your calculator, draw the triangle with vertices at (–2, 1), (–1, 1), and (–1, 3).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19022\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qapps.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19022\u0026quot;,108)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19023\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to enter the application.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19024\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qapps.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19024\u0026quot;,108)\"\u003e and select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19025\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to start the GEOBOARD application. Press any key to start.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3a_60/f-60-3a-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSelect a 8 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19026\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 8 square board.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19027\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e to select a 8 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19028\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 8 square board.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3a_60/f-60-3a-2.gif \"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTurn the axes on.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19029\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qzoom.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19029\u0026quot;,267)\"\u003e (\"FMAT\"), and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19030\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdown.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19030\u0026quot;,136)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19031\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19031\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19032\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19032\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e to turn the axes on. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19033\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19033\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e (\"QUIT\").\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3a_60/f-60-3a-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWe have to graph points with negative coordinates. Move the origin to the center.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eWe have to graph points with negative coordinates. Move the origin to the center.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19034\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19034\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e (\"OPTN\") followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19035\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e to move the origin.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3a_60/f-60-3a-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eUse the arrow keys to move the origin near the center.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eUse the arrow keys to move the origin near the center, as shown. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19036\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19036\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3a_60/f-60-3a-5.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19037\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19037\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e (\"DRAW\") and draw the triangle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19038\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19038\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e (\"DRAW\") and draw the triangle.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMove the cursor to the point (–2, 1) and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19039\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19039\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e (\"ADD\"). Then move the cursor one unit to the right and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19040\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19040\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e(\"ADD\") again. Then move the cursor two units up to (–1, 3), and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19041\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtrace.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19041\u0026quot;,240)\"\u003e (\"DONE\") to complete the triangle.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-11 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_7_1_geometry_3a_60/f-60-3a-6.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    }
  ]
